      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My community also uses public avatars to share avatar between select individuals, and this would be a godsend, to save us the hassle of having to remove and re-upload avatars whenever the wrong person gets their hands on one, through either somebody leaving their cloning on or people using clients to clone them.\nAt the same time it will bring back the ability for maps to have rewarded avatars at the end of a difficult trial because people won't just be able to clone them and will make the reward more meaningful.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
