      "value": "Absolutely this, would definitely help drive traffic(of those who aren't too lazy and will just rip it) to the worlds that these avatars are rewards for. \nObviously Ripping is still going to be an issue since the avatars are stored locally in the cache. But for those who just use VRChat and don't do stuff like that, it would be a great reward for the end of like a puzzle map",
