      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "since this is still a big thing, and hasn't been updated over a year.\nhow about a new parameter for avatar uploads:\nShareable : Private (Uploader) - Specific(by UserID) - Friends (Friends Only) - Public (Anyone, or via Pedestal...)\ni am very unsure of the complexity to implement, but it goes along the line of this post, and has a couple more settings to make sharing avatar more flexible for different creators. no more sharing Password and AuthTokens for avatar creators, too ~!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
